  "about": "The map's datasets as the user sees them: one entry per kind of data, each made of the map layers (app/store.ts LayerId) that hold it for a region, with where it has data, its sources and the docs/DATA_SOURCES.md section that documents it. 'where' lists ISO alpha-2 codes or the regions World, Europe (the ENTSO-E area), EU (the 27 members) and US. 'family' names the coverage registry family (data/coverage.yaml) with per-country status. A dataset with `colour` colours the countries (one at a time) instead of drawing layers. Read by the Datasets panel, the dashboards and the agent.",
